<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA IN FIRST ONE-DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA IN FIRST ONE-DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat India by two runs in the first of three one-day internationals at Colombo's R. Premadasa stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 302 for 4 in 50 overs; India 300 for 7 in 50 overs.</p>
